  "body": "Found by a contributor's quick gate (PR for #2608). The PR does not touch the area preview.\n\n## What happens\n\nOn a clean checkout of `main` at 6df70dfc5 (merge of PR #2760), four tests of `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib` fail:\n\n- `egui_app::tests::frame_cost_caches::pick_lines_build_once_per_input`\n- `egui_app::tests::frame_cost_caches::pick_chips_group_the_welded_faces_once_and_follow_the_picks`\n- `egui_app::tests::frame_cost_probe::area_preview_fill_is_made_once_per_draft`\n- `egui_app::tests::frame_cost_probe::still_frames_on_fig8_name_their_costs`\n\nEach fails at the same assert:\n\n```\npanicked at crates\\ui\\src\\egui_app\\tests\\frame_cost_probe.rs:278:5:\nthe area preview is filled\n```\n\nThe helper `adaptive_preview` creates a 2D Adaptive operation on the biggest fig8 patch with Containment Outside. Then `boundary_viz::preview_fill` gives `None`.\n\nReadings: Windows 11, `cargo test -j 16 -p camcraft-ui --lib -- frame_cost`, 4 failed of 8, two runs. The failure is the same with and without the PR change.\n\n## Related\n\n- #2754 (closed by PR #2760): `shoulder_adaptive` failed on the same fig8 Outside case.\n- #2759: the fig8 Outside path order changes with small mesh changes.\n- The post-merge run for 6df70dfc5 was not complete when this issue was filed. The run for 248b3ac45 failed (`shoulder_adaptive`, `feature_edge_g1_join`, `step_agreement`).\n\n## Labels\n\nI cannot set labels. Suggested: `bug`, `P2` (a gate on main is red), `effort:medium`, `area:ui`.\n\nDone means: the four tests pass on `main`, or the fixture case is changed with a recorded reason.\n",
